. * nwdynam tutorial 1: a first DyNAM on an email event log
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwdynam.
. * The data (manufacturing company emails) are loaded from the web; no files are 
> needed.
. 
. nwdynam version
nwdynam version 1.4.0, 15nov2026
  core package nwcommands : installed (development copy, no distribution date)
  native plugin           : .../nwdynam/lib/plugins/macos/dynam_sim_macos.plugin (ships with the package, no separate version number)
  compared with           : R goldfish 1.6.12
  license                 : GNU GPL-3

. 
. * --- the event data: one row per email, with the time it was sent (in days) ---
. nwwebuse manufacturing, nwclear
(plain Stata dataset loaded - not a saved network file; build a network from it
directly, e.g. with nwfromedge or nwgenerate)

. keep if t < 5
(49,602 observations deleted)

. list in 1/5

     +------------------------------+
     | sender   receiver          t |
     |------------------------------|
  1. |    E39        E81   3.235255 |
  2. |    E39        E81   3.235822 |
  3. |   E112       E136    3.25566 |
  4. |   E112        E60    3.25728 |
  5. |   E112        E57   3.257963 |
     +------------------------------+

. count
  631

. display "span in days: " %5.2f t[_N] - t[1]
span in days:  1.75

