. 
. * --- declare the events as an event network ---
. * The log mentions some of the 154 employees of the company; the others neither 
> send nor receive
. * an email in these five days. They still belong to the risk set, so we add them
>  as isolates.
. quietly levelsof sender, local(a) clean

. quietly levelsof receiver, local(b) clean

. local seen : list a | b

. display "employees in the log: " `: word count `seen''
employees in the log: 102

. tempfile mail

. save `mail'
file /var/folders/hx/2zp2k5ps2y7d_6hx015fcr1h0000gn/T//S_72982.000001 saved as
    .dta format

. nwwebuse manufacturing_nodes, nwclear
(plain Stata dataset loaded - not a saved network file; build a network from it
directly, e.g. with nwfromedge or nwgenerate)

. quietly levelsof label, local(everyone) clean

. display "employees in the company file: " `: word count `everyone''
employees in the company file: 154

. local without : list everyone - seen

. display "employees without an email: " `: word count `without''
employees without an email: 52

. local miss

. foreach e of local without {
  2.     local miss `miss',`e'
  3. }

. local miss = substr("`miss'", 2, .)

. use `mail', clear
(Manufacturing company emails, 2010 (Nurek and Michalski 2020; CC0))

. nwset sender receiver, directed eventtime(t) name(mail)

. nwaddnodes mail, nodenames(`miss')

. nwset
(1 networks)
--------------------
      mail

. 
. * --- the choice sub-model (the default) ---
. nwdynam mail
------------------------------------------------------------
Dynamic Network Actor Model - choice sub-model (MLE)
Network: mail                          Actors: 154
Events: 631                            Log likelihood: -2.31e+03
Note: 3 events share a time point with an earlier event; events with equal times
are simultaneous (as in goldfish).
------------------------------------------------------------
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
        mail | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
     inertia |   1.764848   .1422702    12.40   0.000     1.486004    2.043693
       recip |   2.922411   .1401072    20.86   0.000     2.647806    3.197016
       indeg |   .1096219   .0083143    13.18   0.000     .0933262    .1259177
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. display "log likelihood: " %9.2f e(ll)
log likelihood:  -2307.40

. 
. * --- the rate sub-model ---
. nwdynam mail, submodel(rate)
------------------------------------------------------------
Dynamic Network Actor Model - rate sub-model, no intercept (MLE)
Network: mail                          Actors: 154
Events: 631                            Log likelihood: -2.99e+03
Note: 3 events share a time point with an earlier event; events with equal times
are simultaneous (as in goldfish).
------------------------------------------------------------
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
        mail | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
       indeg |    .032447   .0121149     2.68   0.007     .0087021    .0561918
      outdeg |   .2981679   .0176337    16.91   0.000     .2636064    .3327294
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. 
. * --- stored results ---
. display "sub-model: " e(submodel) ", effects: " e(effects)
sub-model: rate, effects: indeg outdeg

. display "events: " e(N) ", actors: " e(nodes) ", log likelihood: " %9.2f e(ll)
events: 631, actors: 154, log likelihood:  -2986.28

